irs, Guevara recounts adventures he and best friend Alberto Granado had while crossing South America by motorcycle in the early 1950s.","directors":["Walter Salles"],"genres":["Drama"],"imageUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz2aBYT8CAiJYvX4fRZpJ5G0Oz1.jpg","originCountry":["Argentina","France","United Kingdom","United States of America"],"popularity":2.9428,"ratingTMDB":7.416,"runtime":126,"tagline":"Let the world change you...and you can change the world.","title":"The Motorcycle Diaries","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_LAiSdIXos","watchProviders":[],"year":2004},{"actors":["Oleg Menshikov","Nikita Mikhalkov","Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė","Nadezhda Mikhalkova","Vyacheslav Tikhonov","Svetlana Kryuchkova","Vladimir Ilin","Alla Kazanskaya","Nina Arkhipova","Avangard Leontyev"],"backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR6oO0xtzUhRy9pGe5aL0yLARCu.jpg","cardId":213,"description":"Russia, 1936: revolutionary hero Colonel Kotov is spending an idyllic summer in his dacha with his young wife and six-year-old daughter Nadia and other assorted family and friends. Things change dramatically with the unheralded arrival of Cousin Dmitri from Moscow, who charms the women and little Nadia with his games and pianistic bravura. But Kotov isn't fooled: this is the time of Stalin's repression, with telephone calls in the middle of the night spelling doom - and he knows that Dmitri isn't paying a social call...","directors":["Nikita Mikhalkov"],"genres":["Drama"],"imageUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcpvnPSuRrynrgY7menuyZe7X4r.jpg","originCountry":["Russia","France"],"popularity":1.4091,"ratingTMDB":6.9,"runtime":135,"tagline":"A moving and poignant story set against the corrupt politics of the Stalinist era.","title":"Burnt by the Sun","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1gPzpr08hFk","watchProviders":[],"year":1994},{"actors":["Arnold Schwarzenegger","Linda Hamilton","Edward Furlong","Robert Patrick","Earl Boen","Joe Morton","S. Epatha Merkerson","C