ayName":"Patrik Polák","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV_CX3XrGoW5CuAhahZ7-V--H6bHHFcuhTOtq639ZZiMXtvaaie=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104597006403971200128/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJqfkCXNGVC0cRTr-5z28vsJk/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNnOC1uLUFnEAE","publishTime":"2020-10-18T20:08:58.950718Z","rating":2,"text":"This school cafeteria is not good. Most of the meals are below average 👎 and many of them are made from semi-finished products. Also, sometimes strange combinations of ingredients appear. I would also expect that the menu will be adjusted now that the summer is here. For example, instead of broth, they could serve cold cream soup, it would definitely be more successful during high temperatures. A new ordering system was installed in the cafeteria last year, so there is no need to \"fight\" with the old one anymore.\nHopefully, the problem of the school cafeteria closing early (like 10 minutes before the end of lunch service) has also been solved, I did not notice a problem with that last year. Not to be just critical, I liked a few dishes here 👍."},{"authorAttribution":{"displayName":"Ivan Hladeček","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXKu_E0vZ8KepjUZbhr2IGDAg4nogn_eDcqCbnNfaZIuw1YXcMW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109662283234187022439/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJqfkCXNGVC0cRTr-5z28vsJk/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNxanFfaXlnRRAB","publishTime":"2021-06-07T05:23:53.032406Z","rating":5,"text":"They cook great here."},{"authorAttribution":{"displayName":"Šimon Handrych","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLBpQtj8JRUKNCGsEEEw-tsCX509z-yVj8xtIm1qyH3uScJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103423924893211714735/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJqfkCXNGVC0cRTr-5z28vsJk/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1LTZXLWd3RRAB","publishTime":"2022-08-30T17:31:25.225313Z","rating":5,"text":"Pleasant atmosphere, good and cheap lunches. Simply a top dining room. 5 stars."},{"authorAttribution":{"displayName":"Tomáš Březina","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzIWrQ02uP-mJ47e2mVXfULEez7H1fYRSwW6xc2gKEAhrbhQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113244507844166373679/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJqfkCXNGVC0cRTr-5z28vsJk/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURDaHJiWjFBRRAB","publishTime":"2020-09-24T11:54:52.478737Z","rating":1,"text":"Unpleasant service that throws you out as soon as you leave. Lunches not so great either..."},{"authorAttribution":{"displayName":"Max Dražan","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUY3jQ07jKf1uEsTC1ILCcPFf-tqtEYsLdw5PIDUEwOvxsqDu5j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111982172350525990359/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJqfkCXNGVC0cRTr-5z28vsJk/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURXbGZEeXRnRRAB","publishTime":"2022-03-30T10:26:43.768572Z","rating":5,"text":"The dining room is beautiful and also smells of delicious lunches 5/5"}],"placeUrl":"https://maps.google.com/?cid=11074403640976981838&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA","priceLevel":3,"rating":2.9,"restaurantId":1690,"servesVegetarian":false,"takeout":true,"title":"Jídelna ZŠ Vodičkova","type":["cafeteria","point_of_interest","establishment"]}},{"itemId":1263,"rank":4,"run":0,"score":-0.5952854443987267,"cardData":{"cardId":1263,"delivery":false,"goodForGroups":false,"location":{"lat":50.081541599999994,"long":14.4142549},"locationAddress":"Národní, Staré Město, 110 00 Praha-Praha 1, Czechia","openingHours":null,"outdoorSeating":false,"placePhotos":[{"authorAttributions":{"displayName":"Zlata GERGELOVA","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWibMI7hourrezVnIoSCq-3IEUxZV3X0WujCZDLE6Ww47t5b87nlw=s100-p-k-no-mo","uri":"https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116231965707456846721"},"name":"places/ChIJF0wjCwCVC0cRf20EQdgx-IE/photos/AZLasHpWPXyyZZUcu_