00-cc-rp-mo","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105847184664475591411/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJrxjNUOKUC0cR41QL7l_OiHc/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMwcjdPN0Z3EAE","publishTime":"2019-10-15T11:43:22.882929Z","rating":3,"text":"Nice landlady food quality is improving\nLots of screaming children + screaming waitress"},{"authorAttribution":{"displayName":"Sofie Ehlerová","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXb2D5QcbpJgLvhjVGfHrLGQyqcw9IJ6Xge2AQmhJY7lCxl3xU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108592639363871770684/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJrxjNUOKUC0cR41QL7l_OiHc/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ2ckl2cklREAE","publishTime":"2021-09-22T20:02:08.445930Z","rating":3,"text":"good food, the landlady is a mega hottie (always helpful, very nice), the rest of the staff is uncommentary, anti-covid measures are surprising, disadvantaged high school students (it doesn't matter that they also only have a limited time for lunch, they have to eat their lunches outside the cafeteria by 1:00 PM so as not to meet the first grade, but they can sit there for 20 minutes after they shouldn't be there at all, especially in places designated for high school students :(( ) ....but hot food is good 👍"},{"authorAttribution":{"displayName":"Josef Procházka","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK7xrb5cc1wLF39gJ2lZY5BPOLDfkzJnmgEpO4bT0lVthlfeg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115112631099125400813/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJrxjNUOKUC0cR41QL7l_OiHc/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VNWFlpS3V4ajlHTHJ3RRAB","publishTime":"2025-05-25T19:51:10.435088Z","rating":5,"text":""},{"authorAttribution":{"displayName":"Jitka Dvořáková","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocItLYTKp2RCluDfX31j0swDseS14FIrKEOiOtuCwwg5csflVw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2","uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103688203074562279409/reviews"},"name":"places/ChIJrxjNUOKUC0cR41QL7l_OiHc/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG